1236590_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=9w_BhuNCY24Q7kNvwGzh1FR&_nc_oc=AdmSCxzS79wrwzxYvskzoMU9F2jUNWPoYZ6mkHXoJ-Zia_pwWsBQCBUS4QmX6BpwO3s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftslNzhdqiQuOOY0V8U1n81wBGCqJw_sCS7g95ePwl9rA&oe=699C5CE2"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "2560X1440.png", "id": "1250290243014788", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974750_1250290246348121_2726061545124475027_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Nft6WDFMN4QQ7kNvwHqwq_v&_nc_oc=AdkVwmm7NwmEO8uDZJzM1_gFQpR_ZhhdIujB3O0-3ZJV-qGpkqSN5FhYf2kx37BNJKw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfuzQeKRhPkZ1ewoFna7NXu8uoGSMpSxhjkoy0UB65tzfQ&oe=699C5135"}, "display_name": "Side Positioning Assistance Simulator", "keywords": ["CNA", "nurse", "nursing", "training", "simulator"], "long_description": "This Siding Positioning Assistance tutorial trains the essential skill of positioning a patient on their side, focusing on comfort and the prevention of pressure ulcers. The tutorial includes preparation, proper technique for turning and positioning, and ensuring patient safety.  \n\n# Learning Objectives: \n- Remember the steps and protocols for positioning a patient on their side. \n- Understand the importance of proper patient positioning for comfort and pressure ulcer prevention. \n- Apply the correct techniques to position a patient on their side safely. \n- Analyze the patient's condition to determine the best approach for positioning. \n- Evaluate their own technique to ensure it adheres to best practices and safety standards. \n- Create a comfortable and safe environment for patients through proper positioning. \n\nThis comprehensive approach ensures CNAs are well-prepared to assist patients with proper care efficiently and compassionately in real-world clinical settings. ", "short_description": "Master the technique of positioning a patient on their side to ensure comfort and prevent 